{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年11月19日 18:28 星期四</p>\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"dateModified\">最後更新   2026年11月19日 20:20 星期四</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>【20：17更新】今日（19日）下午4時許，警方接報有人於深涌碼頭附近踩單車時受傷暈倒。救援人員到場搜索，發現71歲姓戴男事主昏迷，事主由政府飛行服務隊直升機送往東區醫院搶救。醫院所見，事主左邊額頭近眼角流血。</p></div>\n<div id=\"lower\">\n<div class=\"articlelogin\"><p>據了解，事主與朋友一行三人由西沙Go Park附近出發，踩單車往深涌，其間發生意外，同行朋友報警。據悉事主有身體病記錄，暫未知事主暈倒原因。</p></div><p>相關字詞﹕踩單車 </p> </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T12:57:35.491169+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":243,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T10:28:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T08:37:39.649450+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T12:51:02.325205+00:00","content_hash":"8f9b808b98577dd82fa9451ef973aeff7127d1cb0e6a1b9b4f036c236a297a54","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}